# Copy to mobile/.env and adjust. Restart Expo after changing it
# (EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are baked into the bundle when it is built).
#
# Backend base URL, without /api (it is added automatically). Used for both
# REST and the live-updates socket.
#
# Optional in development:
#   - web (localhost:8081)       defaults to http://localhost:5001
#   - phone or emulator          defaults to your computer's address as Expo
#                                sees it, port 5001
# Set it when the default doesn't reach your backend (another port or
# machine, a tunnel), and always for release builds.
#
# Remember to add the app's web origin (e.g. http://localhost:8081) to
# CORS_ORIGINS in backend/.env. Native apps don't need it.
#
# Examples:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:5001
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
